# The phone's mail engine, pre-bundled into the app by scripts/bundle-engine.mjs. It is the
# fourth door's engine: a 6 MiB generated file with every specifier resolved and every Node
# builtin substituted, rebuilt from source by every phone build. Generated output, never source —
# and the app will not bundle without it, so a missing one is a loud build failure, not a silent
# three-door app.
/generated/
